  "core_method": "Separate IPO Article V §3 urban institutional parity from Article V §35 individual civic rights; pre-1648 antecedents and post-1648 retrospective reports are distinct evidence types.",
  "editorial_holds": [
    "No direct city-council or guild individual case proving implementation of IPO V §35 has been inspected.",
    "Dinkelsbuehl 1653 school and 1654 festival chronology derives from a retrospective festival association and needs city records.",
    "Biberach church Simultaneum began in 1548 and should not be attributed to the 1648 treaty.",
    "Muenster burial disputes documented 1587 and 1590s precede the treaty and cannot prove its implementation.",
    "Augsburg city hospitals/foundations parity is a V §3-related institution not automatically a V §35 individual admission case.",
    "Augsburg academic 2024 paper was read as abstract only; avoid pretending the full text was examined.",
    "Westphalia's legal protections apply to defined historical confessional groups; avoid universal modern rights interpretation.",
    "The archaeological/architectural photographs and existing maps have not been cleared for public reuse.",
